還任豺狼，棄戮親善。行惡求福，如何自勉！前遣陸機董督節鉞，雖黃橋之退，而溫南收勝，一彼一此，未足增慶也。今武士百萬，良將銳猛，要當與兄整頓海內。若能從太尉之命，斬商等首，投戈退讓，自求多福，穎亦自歸鄴都，與兄同之。奉覽來告，緬然慷慨。慎哉大兄，深思進退也！」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0093","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0094","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAI","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0095","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"景","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAH","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0096","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"武皇","kind":"person","person_id":"hgm_jvn_hle","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0097","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"堯","kind":"person","person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0098","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"ddb_l4j_4j2","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0099","start":50,"end":53,"surface":"楊、賈","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resolution_note":"群體／匿名／典故或指代仍待專項辨識，不補造單人。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0100","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"齊","kind":"person","person_id":"ee0_b2a_68e","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0101","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"趙","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p006:m0102","start":8